ror.\n- A usage note in brackets such as （表示…）, alongside an equivalent or in place of one.\nfail when any of these holds:\n- It means something else, or any listed equivalent is wrong for this sense, even when a bracketed note explains the usage correctly.\n- For a verb sense, an equivalent only names a thing or quality and cannot be used as a verb.\n- It renders a phrase or phrasal verb that contains the word instead of the word in this sense.\n- It renders a different sense of the word, such as one of the other senses listed below.\n- It is unnatural or ungrammatical in the target language.\n- It lists equivalents of several unrelated senses.\nOther senses of this entry, for reference:\n- (noun) \"An animal kept for companionship or pleasure.\"\n- (noun) \"A person who receives special affection or preferential treatment from someone.\"\n- (adjective) \"Receiving special personal interest, attention, or affection.\"\n- (verb) \"To kiss and caress someone in a sexual way.\"\n- (noun) \"A kind or lovable person, especially one addressed affectionately.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"pet","pos":"verb","gloss":"To stroke or touch an animal gently and affectionately.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal kept for companionship or pleasure."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person who receives special affection or preferential treatment from someone."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Receiving special personal interest, attention, or affection."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To kiss and caress someone in a sexual way."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A kind or lovable person, especially one addressed affectionately."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T05:16:21.132Z"}', '2026-11-10T05:16:16.928Z', '2026-11-10T05:16:21.132Z', 'zh');
