e lift."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A section of a building that extends from the main part."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A group within a political party or organization with particular views or responsibilities."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"One of the areas at the sides of a theatre stage hidden from the audience."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Either side of the playing field in certain team sports."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A player who plays near the side of the field in certain team sports."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A body panel covering a wheel of a motor vehicle."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A military aviation unit consisting of several squadrons."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To fly or travel swiftly through the air."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To perform or deal with something without preparation."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To wound a bird in a wing or a person in an arm with a shot."}]},"target":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T10:16:20.015Z"}', '2026-11-09T10:16:11.051Z', '2026-11-09T10:16:20.015Z', 'zh');
