pos":"noun","gloss":"A wild animal of the same family as the domestic cat, including lions, tigers, and leopards.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A small domesticated animal with soft fur, whiskers, and retractable claws, often kept as a pet."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person, especially a man."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T08:57:32.206Z"}', '2026-11-10T08:36:46.855Z', '2026-11-10T08:57:32.206Z', NULL);
