es through gills, and has fins.\"\n- (verb) \"To try to catch fish.\"\n- (verb) \"To try indirectly to obtain something from someone.\"\n- (noun) \"The flesh of fish eaten as food.\"\n- (verb) \"To search for something by feeling around with the hands.\"\n- (noun) \"A person of a particular kind or character.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"fish","pos":"verb","gloss":"To pull or take something out of a place, especially with difficulty.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal that lives in water, breathes through gills, and has fins."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To try to catch fish."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To try indirectly to obtain something from someone."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"The flesh of fish eaten as food."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To search for something by feeling around with the hands."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular kind or character."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T03:34:25.621Z"}', '2026-11-10T03:34:16.313Z', '2026-11-10T03:34:25.621Z', NULL);
