pathy, or friendliness."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Based on facts and reasoning without the influence of emotion."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"No longer fresh enough to provide useful clues about someone or something being sought."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Far from finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Giving an impression of coolness through blue, green, or grey tones."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Unconscious."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A common viral infection of the nose and throat that causes sneezing, a runny nose, and sometimes a cough."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A low temperature, especially in the weather or surrounding air."},{"pos":"adverb","gloss":"Without preparation, practice, or prior knowledge."}]},"target":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T12:05:47.755Z"}', '2026-11-09T12:05:43.178Z', '2026-11-10T07:17:37.021Z', NULL);
