ated animal with soft fur, whiskers, and retractable claws, often kept as a pet.","translations":{"zh":"家猫"}},"phrases":[],"review":{"inventory":{"fact_id":"d92dba78-0d04-4e57-9ac4-c6a5e9fe431d","confidence":0.97,"verdict":"pass"},"syllables":{"fact_id":"98bf1615-fc39-4d0a-b728-4a343ccb7eec","confidence":1,"verdict":"pass"},"phrases":null},"forms":[{"form":"cats","type":"plural","pos":"noun"}]}', '8456022d884e8db1315a2ff3695c14cd', '{"lemma":"cat","pos":["noun"],"cefr":"A1","gloss":"A small domesticated animal with soft fur, whiskers, and retractable claws, often kept as a pet.","translations":{"zh":"家猫"}}', 1699, '2026-11-12T05:05:30.520Z');
