d is followed.","labels":["informal"],"region":"british","rare":false,"translations":{"zh":["对（规则或标准）要求严格的"]},"grammar":{"position":"predicative_only","prepositions":["on"],"patterns":[],"review":{"fact_id":"a6c1c202-610b-42e5-9f83-89dbe76d62bd","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}},"examples":[{"text":"Our manager is very hot on punctuality.","translations":{"zh":"我们的经理对守时要求非常严格。"},"review":{"fact_id":"f9ee265f-6b0a-49e7-bd53-a88bb1de9d1d","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}},{"text":"The school is hot on discipline, so students rarely break the rules.","translations":{"zh":"这所学校严抓纪律，所以学生很少违反校规。"},"review":{"fact_id":"ac4f64ac-8c2f-4c23-bf0d-3216e76fc8ba","confidence":0.98,"verdict":"pass"}}],"collocations":[{"text":"hot on discipline","pattern":"adjective_preposition","translations":{},"review":{"fact_id":"31c9478e-c28f-4cf6-a63c-3744de93a43d","confidence":0.98,"verdict":"pass"}}],"topics":[],"relations":{"synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"broader":[],"narrower":[],"part_of":[],"parts":[]},"review":{"gloss":{"fact_id":"ddf60cb3-54e3-4652-8d73-77fb6bd9fb7d","confidence":0.82,"verdict":"pass"},"translations":{"zh":[{"fact_id":"5db70c52-cc60-4507-b542-8cbfa4428cc2","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}]}}},{"id":"16750b2c-f8a8-4507-b4a4-03783943275a","gloss":"Recent enough to provide promising clues about someone or something being sought.","labels":[],"region":null,"rare":false,"translations":{"zh":["（踪迹或线索）新近留下的"]},"grammar":{"position":"both","patterns":[],"prepositions":[],"review":{"fact_id":"a499dda1-c0dd-4098-a900-708e31cff862","confidence":0.81,"verdict":"pass"}},"examples":[{"text":"The dogs picked up a hot scent and raced into the woods.","translations":{"zh":"狗闻到了刚留下不久的气味，飞奔进了树林。"},"review":{"fact_id":"6926dc0f-2835-47c0-8210-1f6963714b68","confidence":0.98,"verdict":"pass"}},{"text":"The detective followed a hot trail to a house near the station.","translations":{"zh":"侦探循着新近留下的踪迹，追查到车站附近的一栋房子。"},"review":{"fact_id":"d99e6f79-3c77-4660-9255-068e8df2d3c3","confiden